{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anime City</strong> combines gameplay of a survival simulator and classic anime visual novels. You will have to study in a Japanese high school, engage in after school activities, and try to make new friends. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215410/extras/0ef2e25efba85111210b8f7d6b8dc6ae.poster.avif?t=1768492037\" width=616 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215410/extras/0ef2e25efba85111210b8f7d6b8dc6ae.webm?t=1768492037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215410/extras/0ef2e25efba85111210b8f7d6b8dc6ae.mp4?t=1768492037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ANIME SIMULATOR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is focused on anime culture, authentically recreating building designs, clothes, food, activities, and other essential elements of anime and manga about school life. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SCHOOL AND CLUBS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to attending regular school classes (history, physical education, Japanese language, cooking) you can  join one of after school clubs (gardening, tennis, drama, science, music) and perform tasks assigned by club leaders. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FRIENDSHIP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can improve your relationships with your classmates and other characters by spending time together and inviting them to club events. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SKILLS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your character's skills (fashion, cooking, science, sports, social, gardening, faith, arts) affect your personal stats, and your success of interactions with other characters. Improving  these skills will require engaging in school activities or after-school clubs. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CUSTOMIZATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can start to play as a girl or a boy, with a range of parameters to customize, and 20+ equipment slots for clothes and accessories.\u00a0You can also set up various furniture and decorations in your apartment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVAL SIMULATOR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your character has health, hunger, thirst, energy, and comfort stats. During the game, you'll have to balance limited resources and take care of your character's needs. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2215410?t=1768492037","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2215410?t=1768492037","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215410/ac4f1810e6d53d2a4619e29e3ebf05176f1db2e0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768492037","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215410/ac4f1810e6d53d2a4619e29e3ebf05176f1db2e0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768492037","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anime City</strong> combines gameplay of a survival simulator and classic anime visual novels. You will have to study in a Japanese high school, engage in after school activities, and try to make new friends. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215410/extras/0ef2e25efba85111210b8f7d6b8dc6ae.poster.avif?t=1768492037\" width=616 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215410/extras/0ef2e25efba85111210b8f7d6b8dc6ae.webm?t=1768492037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215410/extras/0ef2e25efba85111210b8f7d6b8dc6ae.mp4?t=1768492037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ANIME SIMULATOR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is focused on anime culture, authentically recreating building designs, clothes, food, activities, and other essential elements of anime and manga about school life. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SCHOOL AND CLUBS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to attending regular school classes (history, physical education, Japanese language, cooking) you can  join one of after school clubs (gardening, tennis, drama, science, music) and perform tasks assigned by club leaders. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FRIENDSHIP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can improve your relationships with your classmates and other characters by spending time together and inviting them to club events. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SKILLS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your character's skills (fashion, cooking, science, sports, social, gardening, faith, arts) affect your personal stats, and your success of interactions with other characters. Improving  these skills will require engaging in school activities or after-school clubs. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CUSTOMIZATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can start to play as a girl or a boy, with a range of parameters to customize, and 20+ equipment slots for clothes and accessories.\u00a0You can also set up various furniture and decorations in your apartment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVAL SIMULATOR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your character has health, hunger, thirst, energy, and comfort stats. During the game, you'll have to balance limited resources and take care of your character's needs. </p>","developers":["Shoujo City Developer"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215410/29798821ea0f81f09badb7eb3cf397ac5508d1b6/header.jpg?t=1768492037","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> MacOS 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i3-8100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Radeon Pro 5300<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> any</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2215410/541595986/b6ac7476b82aa84fdeba17dac26b9445b0b20d14/1758631499/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758634689","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2215410/541595986/b6ac7476b82aa84fdeba17dac26b9445b0b20d14/1758631499/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758634689","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2215410/541595986/b6ac7476b82aa84fdeba17dac26b9445b0b20d14/1758631499/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758634689","id":257072538,"name":"Anime City Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257072538/6e7f557bb39c5593fa77c497c0e5ca776157dd39/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758634689"}],"name":"Anime City","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Anime City - $14.99 USD","packageid":793531,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":1499}],"title":"Buy Anime City"}],"packages":[793531],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i3-8100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></l